  "description": "Performance meets adventure.\n\nProven Geometry, Evolved\n\nShafer positions riders centrally for an “in the bike” feel, with size-specific chainstays (425–440mm) that balance weight distribution and handling across all sizes. A slack 69° head angle with 50mm fork offset delivers stability and agility, while refined design reduces toe overlap—even on smaller frames—for a smoother, more confident ride.\n\nMassive Tires\n\nShafer brings clearance for 29x2.25” (700x58c) tires with wide rims for added traction, comfort, and speed over rough terrain.\n\nOver 200g lighter\n\nRefined tube shapes and junctions cut significant weight without sacrificing strength, bringing the medium frame down to just 928g and the suspension-corrected carbon fork to 491g, all while adding new features like downtube storage.\n\nSuspension Fork Ready\n\nShafer is compatible with 60mm suspension forks, preserving geometry while boosting control and comfort on rough roads. It blurs the line between gravel and XC, adding even more capability to an already versatile bike.",
